|------|-----|--------|--------|-------|
| 1 | Replace `new HttpClient()` with shared/injected `HttpClient` | 🔴 Prevents socket exhaustion in production | Quick-fix | `NotificationService.cs` |
| 2 | Cache regex as static `[GeneratedRegex]` fields in `LogAnalyzer` | 🔴 ~100x speedup for log parsing | Moderate | `LogAnalyzer.cs` |
| 3 | Replace char-by-char `string +=` with `StringBuilder` in `CsvParser` | 🔴 O(n) vs O(n²) for large CSV files | Quick-fix | `CsvParser.cs` |
| 4 | Cache regex as static fields in `TemplateEngine` | 🔴 Eliminates per-render regex compilation | Quick-fix | `TemplateEngine.cs` |
| 5 | Replace all `string +=` loops with `StringBuilder` | 🟡 O(n) vs O(n²) across all report builders | Quick-fix | 7 files |
| 6 | Cache `GetProperties()` per type in `EntityMapper` | 🟡 ~50x speedup for batch mapping | Moderate | `EntityMapper.cs` |
| 7 | Convert 46 `RegexOptions.Compiled` to `[GeneratedRegex]` in `MarkdownStripper` | 🟡 Eliminates JIT startup cost, faster matching | Moderate | `MarkdownStripper.cs` |
