| 9 | Replace `List.Contains` with `HashSet` in `SlugGenerator.GenerateUniqueSlug` | 🟡 O(1) vs O(n) per lookup in loop | Quick-fix | `SlugGenerator.cs` |
| 10 | Add `CancellationToken` + throttled parallelism to `NotificationService` | 🟡 Prevents unbounded resource usage | Significant | `NotificationService.cs` |

